<title>FRANCE: Algeria seeks 43,000 tonnes maize - traders.</title>
<headline>Algeria seeks 43,000 tonnes maize - traders.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria is in the market to import 43,000 tonnes of maize for March 1-10 shipment, European grain traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It is seeking one cargo of 15,000 tonnes and another of 28,000, they said.</p>
<p>One exporter said Algeria might have already bought some maize from Argentina. But this was yet to be confirmed.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
